Package: dabr
Title: DAB Bindings for R
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("ESSI-Lab", email = "info@essi-lab.eu", role = c("cre", "cph", "fnd")),
    person("Enrico Boldrini", role = "aut",
           comment = "Python reference implementation"))
Maintainer: ESSI-Lab <info@essi-lab.eu>
Description: R client for GeoDAB Data Access Bridge (DAB) services, including
    the Terms API and OGC OM-JSON API (WHOS and HIS-Central). Mirrors the
    capabilities of the dab-py Python package.
